WRF-ARW Testcase with ERA5 MET forcing (*)

This is a test case that uses:
  (a) CONUS SE quadrant domain (98W-75W, 25N-42N) with 1 nest (12 km)
      Lambert projection
  (b) Simulation time period from 00Z 01 Jan 2016 to 12Z 01 Jan 2016
  (c) MODIS geographical data, ERA5 data
  (d) Goddard MP (4ice) and Goddard 2017 radiation (option 57)

(*) European Centre for Medium-Range Weather Forecasts. 2017, updated monthly. ERA5 Reanalysis. Research Data Archive at the National Center for Atmospheric Research, Computational and Information Systems Laboratory. https://doi.org/10.5065/D6X34W69. Accessed 01 Aug 2019
